Ethics & consent
----------------

SoccerTrack v2 was collected with approval from the university ethics board,
covering university-level amateur matches under informed consent. No player
names are included; identification is jersey-number based only. If you
identify a privacy, ethics, or consent issue with any released match, please
open an issue on the public GitHub repository so the maintainers can respond.

